      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, can you help me draft a professional email to a customer? Their order of the Midnight Recovery Serum was delayed by like 4 days because of some logistics mess-up at the Memphis sorting facility. They're pretty annoyed and they're asking for a shipping refund since it didn't arrive when promised. I need it to sound really polished and empathetic since we're a high-end brand, but also clear that we're processing the refund for the shipping costs. Thanks.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
